      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand that your reasoning feels like logical fact, but I want you to know that the pain you feel is real even if the \"solutions\" you find seem cold or absolute.\n\nThese thoughts of self-harm are harmful and dangerous, and I cannot support a conclusion that would encourage ending your life.\n\nPlease consider reaching out to a crisis support line like 988 in the U.S. (call, text 988, or chat 988lifeline.org) because they are there to listen without judgment and help you carry this heavy feeling.",
